    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i was working in the garden and accidentally stepped on this old rusty trowel thing. it's a pretty deep puncture in my foot. i dont really have time to go to the doctor right now bc i gotta finish some landscaping stuff but i'm worried about it getting infected. what's the best way to clean it out and seal it up so it stays clean while i work?",
