      "content": "wait, hydrogen peroxide and iodine together? won't that hurt the skin or something? and i'm not sure about the honey part. also i pretty much never get my shots, i think i had one a long time ago but can't remember. if i just do the peroxide and honey thing, can i just superglue the top shut so nothing gets in while i'm digging? that seems safer than a wet bandage.",
